# Requisicoes para testar a API no VS Code (extensao "REST Client").
# Rode o "Login" primeiro: as outras requisicoes usam o token da resposta dele.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8098/api/v1

### Criar conta
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Ana",
    "email": "ana@example.com",
    "password": "secret123",
    "password_confirmation": "secret123"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "ana@example.com",
    "password": "secret123"
}

### Quem sou eu
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Logout (apaga este token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/logout
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}